IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0014.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY PAY0014C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> UNION DUES DEDUCTED
    05 UNION-DUES         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 3000-UNION-DUES
    DISPLAY "UNION-DUES=" UNION-DUES
    STOP RUN.
3000-UNION-DUES.
    IF UNION-FLG = 'Y'
        IF GRS-PAY-AMT >= 4000
            MOVE 55 TO UNION-DUES
        ELSE
            MOVE 25 TO UNION-DUES
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO UNION-DUES
    END-IF.
